<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 4,540 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 132.24 pence a kilo against 138.30 last week and 109.58 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 93,709 pkgs sold so far this year is 129.64 pence against 113.90 pence for the 122,524 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
